    47	`{schemaVersion, artifactKind: 'cycle-evidence', captureSha256, recordedAt,
    48	stages, events}`（`stages` 冻结 12 员，按 orchestrator-core 编号步归组，
    49	金牌为准）；**文件名按完整 digest 派生**
