    57	`EVIDENCE_WRITE_FAILED` 非零。三码 `EVIDENCE_SCHEMA_REJECTED` /
    58	`EVIDENCE_CREDENTIAL_REJECTED` / `EVIDENCE_WRITE_FAILED`——闭环结论原样，
